# ============================================================================
# AI-Factory — CORE starter env.   cp .env.demo .env   (./start.sh does this too)
# ============================================================================
# This is the 5-line version of the full .env.example. For the core stack you
# only need to add ONE LLM key below. ./start.sh auto-generates every other
# secret (admin password, mesh/monitor tokens) into your .env on first run.
#
# Safe by default: crypto/mainnet is OFF (no wallet, no real funds) unless you
# explicitly set AIFACTORY_CRYPTO_ENABLED=1. Leave it unset for the demo.
#
# ⚠ Never commit your real .env. This .env.demo holds NO real secrets.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ── The ONE thing to fill in: a single LLM key for real AI agents ───────────
# Uncomment ONE line and paste your key. Without a key the stack still boots
# (the Monitor works), but the pipeline falls back to templated output.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ── Optional: point generated products' public links at your local box ──────
AIFACTORY_PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:9080

# Everything else (secrets, ports, tuning) has safe defaults — see .env.example.
